      "text": "[7:06PM] #Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic in and around Adeniji Adele Road is currently flowing smoothly. \nTinubu Square to Tom Jones Intersection via Nnamdi Azikiwe Street is also moving well. Idumota area is experiencing slow traffic towards Eyin Eyo, Balogun, and Martins Streets due to market activities. \nIlubinrin to Carter Bridge inw from Ijora Olopa and Oyingbo is smooth, with no major incidents reported. Traffic officers are actively managing the situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
